{"schema_version": 1, "id": "commentary:Ibn-Ezra:zech-6-6:cell", "corpus_id": "traditional-commentaries", "work": "Ibn Ezra on Zechariah", "locator": "6:6", "url": "https://www.sefaria.org/api/texts/Ibn_Ezra_on_Zechariah?context=0&pad=0", "edition": "Sefaria default Hebrew book response; version metadata preserved in COM-004.manifest.json", "language": "he", "mention_type": "direct", "parent_source_id": "tanakh-wlc-zech-6-6", "quote": "אשר - הזכיר המראה השנית, כי היא עיקר המראה על היהודים אשר נשארו אל ארץ צפון בבל ופרס.\nוהלבנים יצאו אל אחריהם - ולא חשש לדעת את הארץ אשר יצאו שם. \nוהברדים - הם המרכבה הרביעית. \nיצאו - אל דרום, הפך המרכבה השנית שיצאת אל ארץ צפון.", "context": "Entire saved verse commentary cell read; HTML removed. The coloured chariots are directed north and south, especially toward the Jewish communities of Babylon and Persia.", "checks": {"primary_read": true, "quote_verified": true, "context_checked": true, "attribution_verified": true, "commentaries_checked": false, "interpretation_prepared": true, "independent_reviewed": false}, "interpretation": "The coloured chariots are directed north and south, especially toward the Jewish communities of Babylon and Persia.", "epistemic_type": "traditional_commentary", "reviewers": ["research-runner"], "task_id": "COM-004", "role": "zechariah_horse_vision_interpretation", "limitations": ["Default digital Hebrew response may combine versions; no print/manuscript collation.", "No independent review; historical identifications are preserved as Abarbanel/Ibn Ezra interpretations, not externally verified history."], "accessed_at": "2026-10-11", "period_status": "Historical composition/edition dating not independently established", "confidence": {"quotation": "verified_in_named_digital_witness", "interpretation": "working_contextual_reading"}}
